WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.959 --> 00:00:01.584
I'm ready...

00:00:01.584 --> 00:00:02.085
Woo!

00:00:02.252 --> 00:00:03.545
This is really crazy.

00:00:03.545 --> 00:00:04.421
to take my life...

00:00:05.130 --> 00:00:06.172
I felt about as close

00:00:06.172 --> 00:00:06.798
