00:00:06.798 --> 00:00:07.340
possibly get.

00:00:07.924 --> 00:00:08.508
To the edge.

00:00:10.593 --> 00:00:12.929
That's how we do it!

00:00:13.138 --> 00:00:15.140
Huah!

